    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94927" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σκῑρῖται</span></b> , οἱ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the Scirites</i>, a light-armed
			division of the Spartan army, named from the town <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σκῖρος</span> in Arcadia, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.67
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				68
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				71
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.2.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lac.</u>
				12.3
			</span></i>, etc.: also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σκιρίτης</span></b> 
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					15.32
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
